        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>중대재해 예방매뉴얼</choice_text>
          <commentary>중대재해 예방매뉴얼은 해당하지 않으므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>위기대응 실무매뉴얼</choice_text>
          <commentary>위기대응 실무매뉴얼은 해당한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>현장조치 행동매뉴얼</choice_text>
          <commentary>현장조치 행동매뉴얼은 해당한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
